ings to extend your time. No two runs are ever the same. \n\nHow long can you last?", "short_description": "Fly through a retro-inspired void while dodging endless obstacles.\n\nThis is a trippy and challenging endless runner/flyer, inspired by classic arcade games and re-imagined for VR using procedural generation. \n\nDodge the blocks and fly through the rings to extend your time. No two runs are ever the same. \n\nHow long can you last?"}]}, "developer_name": "James Vidler", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dodgeblockvr.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://dodgeblockvr.com/", "publisher_name": "Vidler Studios", "support_website_url": "https://dodgeblockvr.com/", "website_url": "https://dodgeblockvr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "CASUAL", "FLYING"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "637695454143707"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_620048248409439_566215013329534976_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vUtU43VhVRUQ7kNvwELR6lq&_nc_oc=AdqyAtNGr2n1Th3EB1r6R-jMnPEbKz7s4aEn8Usv7wYHCD-Vg73DAmWbyjVxBaj5ldE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1Hzq9js6LRNAS1papLM6Wx1NDnMHoWOeTZaDWo4XFQow&oe=69EB788E"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Dodgeblock", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "release_